      "source": "Microsoft Learn Policy CSP System, AllowTelemetry (Group Policy 'Allow Diagnostic Data', HKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\DataCollection\\AllowTelemetry; 1 = Required, the default; 0 = Security, Enterprise/Education/Server only; 3 = Optional); Microsoft Learn 'Configure Windows diagnostic data in your organization'; Windows Insider 'data settings'.",
