      "description": "Display Driver Uninstaller removes every trace of a graphics driver so a fresh one installs cleanly. For a broken driver or a switch between GPU brands, not for routine updates.",
      "risk": "manual",
      "limitations": "Removes the driver's settings and profiles. A BitLocker-encrypted PC may ask for its recovery key when started in Safe Mode.",
