      "source": "Microsoft Learn Policy CSP Search 'AllowSearchToUseLocation': 'specifies whether search and Cortana can provide location aware search and Cortana results', most restrictive value 0, default 1, Windows 10 1507+, Pro/Enterprise/Education, key SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Windows Search, value AllowSearchToUseLocation (Search.admx). Learn 'Manage connections...' item 2.1 gives the same registry value = 0 for 'Allow search and Cortana to use location'.",
