      "summary": "Windows search does not look into your OneDrive, Outlook or SharePoint.",
      "description": "Sets 'Allow Cloud Search' to disabled: Windows Search and Cortana do not search cloud sources such as OneDrive and SharePoint for any user of this PC, whether signed in with a Microsoft or a work or school account. Local file search is unchanged.",
